{
  "dump_dir": "/projects/illinois/eng/cee/ctessum/ctessum/data/eqwefic/dumps/wsm6",
  "model": "WSM6ColdAccretion",
  "tests": [
    {
      "id": "qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_accretion",
      "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_quarter_ss idealized supercell (GNU real32 build, dx = 2 km, dt = 12 s, 40 layers, WSM6 only) dumped by the instrumented ctessum-claude/WRF fork (module_esm_dump with esm_dump_inner hooks inside mp_wsm6_run of the ctessum-claude/MMM-physics fork, commit 52cfbd7) and replayed through the real64 (kind_phys = real64) standalone kernels/wsm6_driver at the WRF step. POINTWISE and step-free: the inputs are the state at which the kernel evaluates its process rates (t_rates, qc/qi/qr/qs/qg_rates after the sub-step's sedimentation, melting, freezing and slope update; den), the expected values the rates the kernel dumps right after evaluating them (`<rate>_raw`: after each process's own time-step limiter, before the mass-conservation rescaling) and the mp_wsm6_init coefficients, from the real64 replay. No small-dt replay because WSM6's increments are not rate x dt (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N3). The size distributions, N_i, D_i and fall speeds come from hydrometeor_slopes.esm mounted as subsystem sd on the same inputs (its own tests pin them to the dump). Real64 replay vs real32 dump: <= 1e-5 relative in these rates. Residual esm-vs-real64 mismatch, from the kernel's default-real literals and real32 WRF constants (pi, avtr, bvtr, bvts, n0s, dens, 0.07, 1.49e4, 1.31, 5.38e7, 11.9, ...; FORTRAN_BUGS.md N2), measured with zero tolerances: <= 1.7e-7 of each column's maximum (psaci; praci 8e-9, piacr 6e-8, pgaci 3e-8, psacw 9e-8, pracs 2e-8, psacr 1.4e-8, pgacr 5e-9, pgeml 6e-8). Tolerances are set 5-10x above: relative 1e-6 on the coefficients, absolute Linf_error bounds on the limited whole columns at 1e-6 of each column's maximum, and relative 2e-6 spot checks of the UNLIMITED rates at layers where the kernel's limiter is provably inactive (the dumped rate is below half of q/dtcld there; in this column only pracs at layer 11 and pgacr at layer 13 are limited). Regime: supercell step 250 (t = 50 min), row j = 23, column i = 24: freezing level at layer 9; rain 1-16, cloud water 1-20, snow 6-33, graupel 1-33, ice 9-39; every accretion process is active (praci/piacr/pracs/psacr in 9-16, psaci/pgaci in 9-32, psacw 9-20, pgacw/pgacr from layer 8, where T is just above 0 C so pgeml is active at 1.5e-18 kg/kg/s and pseml is zero because there is no snow). Exception: pseml and pgeml are proportional to the supercooling T0 - T, which is -0.15 K in the only active layer, so the kernel's real32 T0 = 273.1499939 K (6e-6 K off) shows up as a 4e-6 relative difference; their tolerances are therefore rel 5e-5 and Linf 1e-4 of the column maximum.",
      "inputs": "qss_ref_9983.json",
      "reference": "qss_ref_9983_driver_dtwrf.json",
      "column": 23,
      "fields_library": "tests/qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_accretion_inputs.esm",
      "fields": {
        "input_T": { "expr": "t_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qc": { "expr": "qc_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qi": { "expr": "qi_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qr": { "expr": "qr_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qs": { "expr": "qs_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qg": { "expr": "qg_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_rho": { "expr": "den", "axis": "lev" }
      },
      "parameter_overrides": { "dtcld": "dtcld" },
      "assertions": [
        { "variable": "pacrc", "expr": "pacrc", "tolerance": { "rel": 1e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pacrg", "expr": "pacrg", "tolerance": { "rel": 1e-6 } },
        { "variable": "praci_lim", "expr": "praci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-13 } },
        { "variable": "piacr_lim", "expr": "piacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 5e-14 } },
        { "variable": "psaci_lim", "expr": "psaci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "pgaci_lim", "expr": "pgaci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-12 } },
        { "variable": "psacw_lim", "expr": "psacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "pgacw_lim", "expr": "pgacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 3e-11 } },
        { "variable": "paacw", "expr": "paacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 3e-11 } },
        { "variable": "pracs_lim", "expr": "pracs_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "psacr_lim", "expr": "psacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 3e-12 } },
        { "variable": "pgacr_lim", "expr": "pgacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-9 } },
        { "variable": "pgacs", "expr": "pgacs_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 0 } },
        { "variable": "pseml_lim", "expr": "pseml_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 0 } },
        { "variable": "pgeml_lim", "expr": "pgeml_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-22 } },
        { "variable": "praci", "expr": "praci_raw", "coords": { "lev": [13, 14, 15, 16] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "piacr", "expr": "piacr_raw", "coords": { "lev": [9, 12, 16] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "psaci", "expr": "psaci_raw", "coords": { "lev": [9, 16, 24, 32] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pgaci", "expr": "pgaci_raw", "coords": { "lev": [9, 16, 24, 32] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "psacw", "expr": "psacw_raw", "coords": { "lev": [9, 14, 20] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pgacw", "expr": "pgacw_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8, 14, 20] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pracs", "expr": "pracs_raw", "coords": { "lev": [14, 15, 16] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "psacr", "expr": "psacr_raw", "coords": { "lev": [9, 12, 16] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pgacr", "expr": "pgacr_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8, 10, 12, 16] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pgeml", "expr": "pgeml_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 5e-5 } },
        { "variable": "praci", "expr": "0*praci_raw", "coords": { "lev": [1, 8, 20, 40] }, "tolerance": { "abs": 0 } },
        { "variable": "psaci", "expr": "0*psaci_raw", "coords": { "lev": [1, 8, 33, 40] }, "tolerance": { "abs": 0 } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qss_step250_row23_col25_enhanced_melting",
      "description": "Same reference chain, regime and tolerance reasoning as qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_accretion, one tile column to the east (i = 25): the layer just above freezing (layer 8, T = 273.3 K) holds snow, graupel, rain and cloud water at once, so both enhanced-melting terms pseml (1.3e-15) and pgeml (1.7e-14 kg/kg/s) are active and unlimited there, together with the above-freezing accretions psacw, pgacw, psacr and pgacr that feed them. Measured residual <= 6e-8 of column maximum in every accretion rate; pseml and pgeml differ by 1.6e-5 relative because they multiply the supercooling T0 - T = -0.15 K, where the kernel's real32 T0 (273.1499939 K) is 6e-6 K off, hence rel 5e-5 / Linf 1e-4 of column maximum for those two.",
      "inputs": "qss_ref_9983.json",
      "reference": "qss_ref_9983_driver_dtwrf.json",
      "column": 24,
      "fields_library": "tests/qss_step250_row23_col25_enhanced_melting_inputs.esm",
      "fields": {
        "input_T": { "expr": "t_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qc": { "expr": "qc_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qi": { "expr": "qi_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qr": { "expr": "qr_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qs": { "expr": "qs_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qg": { "expr": "qg_rates", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_rho": { "expr": "den", "axis": "lev" }
      },
      "parameter_overrides": { "dtcld": "dtcld" },
      "assertions": [
        { "variable": "pseml_lim", "expr": "pseml_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-19 } },
        { "variable": "pgeml_lim", "expr": "pgeml_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-18 } },
        { "variable": "pseml", "expr": "pseml_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 5e-5 } },
        { "variable": "pgeml", "expr": "pgeml_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 5e-5 } },
        { "variable": "psacw_lim", "expr": "psacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "pgacw_lim", "expr": "pgacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 3e-11 } },
        { "variable": "paacw", "expr": "paacw_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 3e-11 } },
        { "variable": "psacr_lim", "expr": "psacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 5e-12 } },
        { "variable": "pgacr_lim", "expr": "pgacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 5e-10 } },
        { "variable": "praci_lim", "expr": "praci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-13 } },
        { "variable": "piacr_lim", "expr": "piacr_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-13 } },
        { "variable": "psaci_lim", "expr": "psaci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "pgaci_lim", "expr": "pgaci_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 2e-12 } },
        { "variable": "pracs_lim", "expr": "pracs_raw", "axis": "lev", "reduce": "Linf_error", "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-11 } },
        { "variable": "psacw", "expr": "psacw_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8, 12, 19] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "psacr", "expr": "psacr_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8, 12, 15] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } },
        { "variable": "pgacr", "expr": "pgacr_raw", "coords": { "lev": [8, 11, 15] }, "tolerance": { "rel": 2e-6 } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scm_call120_ice_only_no_accretion",
      "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_scm_xy single-column run (GNU real32 build, dt = 60 s, 59 layers, mp = 6, sfclay = 1, slab, YSU) at call 120 (step 60, 20:00 UTC), lowest 40 of the 59 layers (esm-spec 6.6 tests cannot rebind NLEV), replayed through the real64 kernels/wsm6_driver. Zero check: the column holds only cloud ice (qi <= 5e-5 in layers 30-40), no cloud water, rain, snow or graupel, so every collection rate and both enhanced-melting terms must be exactly zero although the ice-phase gates (T < 0 C, qi > qmin) are open in layers 25-40; the coefficients are still checked.",
      "inputs": "scm_ref_120.json",
      "reference": "scm_ref_120_driver_dtwrf.json",
      "column": 0,
      "fields_library": "tests/scm_call120_ice_only_no_accretion_inputs.esm",
      "fields": {
        "input_T": { "expr": "t_rates[:40]", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qc": { "expr": "qc_rates[:40]", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qi": { "expr": "qi_rates[:40]", "axis": "lev" },
        "input_qr": { "expr": "qr_rates[:40]", "axis": "lev" },
